# Language: English

All user-facing content in this project is **English**.

- Stage names, inputs, outputs, toolbar labels, legends, drawers, and metadata descriptions: English
- Dutch terms from source materials (Idee, Validatie, Productie, Goedgekeurde, etc.) must be translated before display
- Do not ship mixed NL/EN labels in the visualizer
- Keep `lang="en"` on the document root
